$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: To a suspension of
N-(7-bromo-4-oxo-3-((5-phenyltetrahydrofuran-2-yl)methyl)-3,4-dihydroquinazolin-2-yl)benzamide
(rac-10b) (50 mg 0.099 mmol) in THF (4 mL) and H2O (1 mL),
2-(4-butylphenyl)-4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolane (13a) (34 mg,
0.129 mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (5 mg, 0.005 mmol), and K2CO3 (42 mg, 0.3 mmol)
were added. The resulting mixture was heated at 80°C overnight. After the
reaction was completed, the solution was cooled to room temperature and
then partitioned between H2O and EtOAc. The organic layer was
concentrated in vacuo and crystallized from MeOH. Protected intermediate
(27 mg, 46% yield) that was used in the next step without additional
purification. To a suspension of protected intermediate (25 mg, 0.044
mmol) in EtOH (5 mL), hydrazine hydrate (0.1 mL) was added and the
mixture was refluxed for 2 h. Solvent was evaporated, and water was added
and extracted with EtOAc. Organic phase was separated, washed with brine,
and dried over Na2SO4. Product was purified by column chromatography
(EtOAc/PE = 1/2), Final product rac -4a (15 mg, 75%) as a white amorphous
solid.
2-Amino-7-(4-pentylphenyl)-3-(((2S*,5R*)-5-phenyltetrahydrofuran-2-yl)methyl)quinazolin-4(3H)-one
(rac-4b). Prepared in analogy to compound rac -4a.
2-Amino-7-(4-phenethylphenyl)-3-(((2S*,5R*)-5-phenyltetrahydrofuran-2-yl)methyl)quinazolin-4(3H)-one
(rac-4i). Prepared in analogy to compound rac-4a. Yield 35 mg (70% in two
steps), amorphous solid. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): 1.85-1.98 (2H, m),
2.24-2.43 (2H, m), 2.98 (4H, s), 4.21 (1H, dd, J = 7.2 Hz, 14.6 Hz),
4.35-4.45 (1H, m), 4.68 (1H, dd, J = 1.2 Hz, 14.6 Hz), 4.91 (1H, t, J =
7.2 Hz), 5.72 (2H, brs), 7.18-7.26 (3H, m), 7.27-7.29 (11H, m), 7.46 (1H,
dd, J = 1.7 Hz, 8.3 Hz), 7.55 (1H, d, J = 1.5 Hz), 7.60 (2H, d, J = 8.3
Hz), 8.18 (1H, d, J = 8.3 Hz). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 28.8, 33.3,
37.6, 37.8, 46.6, 79.8, 82.1, 115.8, 122.0, 122.2, 126.0, 127.3, 127.6,
128.0, 128.4, 128.3, 128.4, 128.7, 129.0, 137.7, 141.4, 141.6, 142.0,
147.2, 149.1, 153.3, 162.9. HRMS (ESI/TOF-Q) m/z: [M+H]+ calcd for
C33H32N3O2, 502.2495; found, 502.2501.
